<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK MUTUAL FUND FLOWS, ASSETS.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK MUTUAL FUND FLOWS, ASSETS.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ionian Bank reported the following daily and year-to-date changes in the volume of Greek mutual fund outstanding shares, net assets and net share prices, as well as total net asset sizes as of June 30.</p>
<p>				  June 30/June 27  June 30/Dec 31, 96</p>
<p>						 (%)		  (%)</p>
<p>NET SHARE PRICES*</p>
<p>  Total market			    0.12		 7.42</p>
<p>  Fixed income &amp;money market funds  0.08		 5.87</p>
<p>  International funds		   0.32		10.95</p>
<p>  Growth Funds			    0.75		50.35</p>
<p>* Prices include distributed dividends</p>
<p>VOLUME OF SHARES</p>
<p>  Total market			   -1.03		34.33</p>
<p>  Fixed income &amp;money market funds -1.09		34.89</p>
<p>  International funds		   0.01		13.98</p>
<p>  Growth funds			    0.19		30.80</p>
<p>NET ASSETS</p>
<p>  Total market			   -0.95		42.56</p>
<p>  Fixed income &amp;money market funds -1.06		41.29</p>
<p>  International funds		   0.32		24.23</p>
<p>  Growth funds			    0.97		91.78</p>
<p>All calculations are based on a performance index of mutual funds whose base was set to be equal to 100 on December 31, 1991.</p>
